          "resource": "repo://backend/vsir/cli.py#L1-L11",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bae0b0d2ce686c9490fa692906dbe73c438486edb99c8863b21918f0f363ef4c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2e72584f84b140a0889193290f59a451",
      "statement": "main() configures logging from the raw environment before any check runs, because the boot self-check reports a missing or malformed log level and needs a working logger to report with, then installs the signal handler and runs exactly one command.",
      "evidence": [
